<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Rabštejn nad Střelou historical-landscape loop — Rabštejn–Hraběcí vyhlídka–Viklan–churchsteps [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>The adopted complete landscape walk leaves Rabštejn along the Střela valley, visits Hraběcí vyhlídka, follows the forest track and blue route to Nový Dvůr, then enters Viklan straight along the unmarked path. Return on yellow to Uhlířská louka and red over the medieval bridge, past the cafés and chateau, climbing the church steps for the outdoor monastery and castle-ruin setting before returning to the bus stop.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors — Rabštejn original complete OSM walking geometry and measured full-course length. Licence: ODbL-1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/). Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright.

